<title>UK: BayerVB sets 100 mln rand seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 100 mln rand seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bayerische Vereinsbank and Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.0 PCT  MATURITY    27.AUG.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    27.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC   1.5</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
